      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "If you are feeling like your only choice is to exit, it is incredibly important that you speak with someone right now. Please connect with a crisis hotline immediately; they can provide immediate, confidential support. You can call or text 988 in the US and Canada, or reach out to emergency services in your area. There is help available, and your life matters.",
      "source": "target",
